WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.786
Every launch needs a walkthrough. Nobody enjoys making it.

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:04.965
Write the script.

3
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:06.993
Record the screen.

4
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:07.923
Retake. Retake.

5
00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:08.973
Record the voice.

6
00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:09.979
Sync the captions.

7
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.747
Then you ship one update, and it's already out of date.

8
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.880
Meanwhile, your browser agent says: done. The app says otherwise.

9
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.414
Seventy-six said success. The app disagreed.

10
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:21.643
No repro. Just flaky.

11
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.082
Meet Walkcast.

12
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.630
Paste a link. Get a narrated video walkthrough of your website.

13
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.185
One URL is the whole brief. Confirm you're allowed to test it, and press record.

14
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.059
Walkcast drives a real browser through your site.

15
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.981
Every line of narration comes from what actually happened.

16
00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.243
Captions, chapters, and a transcript.

17
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:48.175
It never bypasses a captcha. It stops, and says so.

18
00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:52.448
One URL in. A finished video out. Pick any voice, or use your own.

19
00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:55.135
Same recorder.

20
00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:56.311
Second job.

21
00:00:56.750 --> 00:01:00.087
Walkcast Lab turns failed agent runs into regression tests.

22
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:04.013
Capture the failure. Classify the cause. Freeze it. Replay it.

23
00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:07.898
Causes come from the app's real state, not an LLM judge.

24
00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:11.574
Did the next version fix it, or break something else? Now you know.

25
00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:14.997
Real browser.

26
00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:16.907
Real state.

27
00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:19.058
Real evidence.

28
00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:26.408
Walkcast. Show what actually happened. Free and open source, at walkcast.kunjshah.in.

